      "source": "./finance-plugins/qcc-due-diligence",
      "description": "面向金融机构的企业尽职调查工具包，通过企查查（QCC）商业数据库提供 KYB 核验、UBO 穿透、授信尽调、贷后监控、破产预警、诉讼分析、贸易融资合规等 13 项核心业务能力。",
      "version": "1.0.2",
      "author": {
        "name": "liantian"
      },
      "license": "MIT",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/liantian-cn/cc-marketplace/",
      "repository": "https://github.com/liantian-cn/cc-marketplace/tree/main/finance-plugins/qcc-due-diligence",
      "category": "金融风控"
    },
    {
      "name": "essentials",
      "source": "./plugins/essentials",
      "description": "liantian cc market 基础文档处理技能集合：PDF、Word(docx)、PowerPoint(pptx)、Excel(xlsx) 的创建/编辑/分析，MarkItDown 格式转换，网页 PPT 生成（guizang-ppt）等。",
      "version": "1.0.10",
      "author": {
        "name": "liantian"
      },
      "license": "MIT",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/liantian-cn/cc-marketplace/",
